            <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Do Meta Ads still work after iOS privacy changes?</h3>
            <p>Yes, but only with proper setup: Conversions API alongside the pixel, broad targeting with strong creative, and first-party data. Accounts that still run 2019-style narrow interest stacks struggle — that is a setup problem, not a platform problem.</p>
            <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Who makes the ad creatives?</h3>
            <p>We write the copy and produce static and simple motion creatives from your product photos and brand assets. If you have raw footage, even phone-shot, we can turn it into performing ad creative. Full video production is scoped separately.</p>
            <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">How quickly will Meta Ads produce sales or leads?</h3>
            <p>The learning phase typically needs 1-2 weeks of conversion data. Expect the first month to be about finding winning audiences and creative; months 2-3 are where return on ad spend usually stabilizes. We report all of it transparently.</p>
            <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">Should I run Meta Ads or Google Ads?</h3>
            <p>Meta creates demand with creative and targeting — strongest for visual products, e-commerce, and local awareness. <a href="../google-ads-management/">Google</a> captures people already searching. Many clients run both with different jobs. See our <a href="../../blogs/google-ads-vs-meta-ads-which-platform-converts-better/">honest comparison</a>.</p>

